{"id":"9d0a020880cb80e9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bss-machine.md","title":"Equality-Branch BSS Machines","display":"df-bss-machine — Equality-Branch BSS Machines","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bss-machine","aliases":["28-df-bss-machine"],"display":"df-bss-machine — Equality-Branch BSS Machines","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.3, explicit tape/register operational completion","source_printed_pages":"331–332","source_pdf_pages":"357–358","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bss-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bss-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bss-machine — Equality-Branch BSS Machines"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.3, explicit tape/register operational completion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"331–332"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"357–358"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\mathbb F\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\mathbb F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(a)=a\">\\(\\nu(a)=a\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb F\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb F\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(\\bot)=0\">\\(\\nu(\\bot)=0\\)</span>。配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(q,h,\\tau,r)\">\\(c=(q,h,\\tau,r)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb F\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\">\\(\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\)</span> 仅有限个非空白位置。</li>\n<li>程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta)\">\\(M=(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta)\\)</span> 有有限状态集与三个互异指定状态；非停机状态命令为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;)\">\\(\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;)\">\\(\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0\">\\(j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0\\)</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;)\">\\(\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\)</span>）。j=0指当前带格，j=1指辅助寄存器；所有后继属于Q。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau[h\\mapsto v]\">\\(\\tau[h\\mapsto v]\\)</span> 为单点更新；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb F^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb F^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,c&#39;\\in\\mathscr C_M\">\\(c,c&#39;\\in\\mathscr C_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c.q\">\\(c.q\\)</span> 表示状态投影。下式构造配置集、总后继函数及吸收扩展计算序列：无后继配置保持原值，正常停机态与非法除零卡住态由状态标签区分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;):d\\in\\{-1,1\\},q&#39;\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;):j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0,q&#39;\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;):j\\in\\{0,1\\},a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},q_1,q_0&#39;\\in Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;):d\\in\\{-1,1\\},q&#39;\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;):j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0,q&#39;\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;):j\\in\\{0,1\\},a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},q_1,q_0&#39;\\in Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta):Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |Q|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ q_0,q_A,q_R\\in Q,\\ |\\{q_0,q_A,q_R\\}|=3,\\ \\delta:Q\\setminus\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\to\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta):Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |Q|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ q_0,q_A,q_R\\in Q,\\ |\\{q_0,q_A,q_R\\}|=3,\\ \\delta:Q\\setminus\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\to\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_x(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_{i+1}&amp;0\\le i&lt;n,\\\\\\bot&amp;i\\notin\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad c^0_{M,x}\\coloneqq(q_0,0,\\tau_x,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_x(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_{i+1}&amp;0\\le i&lt;n,\\\\\\bot&amp;i\\notin\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad c^0_{M,x}\\coloneqq(q_0,0,\\tau_x,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_c\\coloneqq\\nu(\\tau(h)),\\qquad b_c\\coloneqq r,\\qquad v_j(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\tau(h)&amp;j=0,\\\\b_c&amp;j=1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_c\\coloneqq\\nu(\\tau(h)),\\qquad b_c\\coloneqq r,\\qquad v_j(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\tau(h)&amp;j=0,\\\\b_c&amp;j=1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nc\\Rightarrow_M c&#39;\\leftrightarrow q\\notin\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\land\\big[&amp;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\ \\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;)\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h+d,\\tau,r))\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B]\\ \\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathbb F\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;)\\land Q_1(a_c,b_c)\\ne0\\land vQ_1(a_c,b_c)=P(a_c,b_c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land((j=0\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h,\\tau[h\\mapsto v],r))\\lor(j=1\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h,\\tau,v))))\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\ \\exists q_1,q_0&#39;\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;)\\land((v_j(c)=a\\land c&#39;=(q_1,h,\\tau,r))\\lor(v_j(c)\\ne a\\land c&#39;=(q_0&#39;,h,\\tau,r))))\\big].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nc\\Rightarrow_M c&#39;\\leftrightarrow q\\notin\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\land\\big[&amp;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\ \\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{shift}(d,q&#39;)\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h+d,\\tau,r))\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B]\\ \\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathbb F\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q&#39;)\\land Q_1(a_c,b_c)\\ne0\\land vQ_1(a_c,b_c)=P(a_c,b_c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land((j=0\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h,\\tau[h\\mapsto v],r))\\lor(j=1\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,h,\\tau,v))))\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\ \\exists q_1,q_0&#39;\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0&#39;)\\land((v_j(c)=a\\land c&#39;=(q_1,h,\\tau,r))\\lor(v_j(c)\\ne a\\land c&#39;=(q_0&#39;,h,\\tau,r))))\\big].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr C_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,h,\\tau,r):q\\in Q,\\ h\\in\\mathbb Z,\\ r\\in\\mathbb F,\\ \\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ |\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne\\bot\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr C_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,h,\\tau,r):q\\in Q,\\ h\\in\\mathbb Z,\\ r\\in\\mathbb F,\\ \\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ |\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne\\bot\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_M\\coloneqq\\{(c,c&#39;)\\in\\mathscr C_M^2:c\\Rightarrow_M c&#39;\\lor(c&#39;=c\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathscr C_M\\ c\\Rightarrow_M d)\\},\\qquad F_M:\\mathscr C_M\\to\\mathscr C_M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_M\\coloneqq\\{(c,c&#39;)\\in\\mathscr C_M^2:c\\Rightarrow_M c&#39;\\lor(c&#39;=c\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathscr C_M\\ c\\Rightarrow_M d)\\},\\qquad F_M:\\mathscr C_M\\to\\mathscr C_M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq F_M(c^t_{M,x})\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\coloneqq(c^t_{M,x})_{t\\in\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq F_M(c^t_{M,x})\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\coloneqq(c^t_{M,x})_{t\\in\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\min(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:(c^t_{M,x}).q\\in\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}),\\qquad\\operatorname{out}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)&lt;\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_A,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)&lt;\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_R,\\\\\\uparrow&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\min(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:(c^t_{M,x}).q\\in\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}),\\qquad\\operatorname{out}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)&lt;\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_A,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)&lt;\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_R,\\\\\\uparrow&amp;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原书仅相等测试、任意固定域常数、单位成本精确域运算的模型。本条将原书略写的辅助寄存器读写展开为二参数有理更新；这是显式操作语义补全，未宣称逐步成本与原段落完全相同。有限程序每条有固定有限次数多项式，未允许顺序比较、取整、无限描述常量或运行期任意有理函数。</p>\n<p>来源：§16.3, explicit tape/register operational completion；印刷页 331–332；PDF 页 357–358。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Equality-Branch BSS Machines，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R5独立G5复核：相等分支读取当前带格的原始符号并允许比较空白；仅算术通过ν将空白转换为0。这样不同长度全零输入仍可由首次空白位置区分，未丢失输入终止信息。辅助寄存器始终在域内，故与空白比较永假。</p>\n<p>计算递归的良定义性：每个非停机状态只有一个命令，平移、相等测试和非零分母的域除法各给唯一后继；零分母及停机状态无后继。因此F_M图恰为全单值函数，标准自然数递归给唯一吸收扩展Run。卡在非停机态除零时其状态永非q_A/q_R，故time仍为∞。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(a)=a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(\\bot)=0","display":false},{"tex":"c=(q,h,\\tau,r)","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{shift}(d,q')","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q')","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0')","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau[h\\mapsto v]","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb F^n","display":false},{"tex":"c,c'\\in\\mathscr C_M","display":false},{"tex":"c.q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{shift}(d,q'):d\\in\\{-1,1\\},q'\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q'):j\\in\\{0,1\\},P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B],Q_1\\ne0,q'\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0'):j\\in\\{0,1\\},a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},q_1,q_0'\\in Q\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb F}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,q_0,q_A,q_R,\\delta):Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |Q|<\\aleph_0,\\ q_0,q_A,q_R\\in Q,\\ |\\{q_0,q_A,q_R\\}|=3,\\ \\delta:Q\\setminus\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\to\\mathcal K_{\\mathbb F}(Q)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_x(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_{i+1}&0\\le i<n,\\\\\\bot&i\\notin\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad c^0_{M,x}\\coloneqq(q_0,0,\\tau_x,0).","display":true},{"tex":"a_c\\coloneqq\\nu(\\tau(h)),\\qquad b_c\\coloneqq r,\\qquad v_j(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\tau(h)&j=0,\\\\b_c&j=1.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nc\\Rightarrow_M c'\\leftrightarrow q\\notin\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\land\\big[&\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\ \\exists q'\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{shift}(d,q')\\land c'=(q',h+d,\\tau,r))\\\\\n\\lor&\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists P,Q_1\\in\\mathbb F[A,B]\\ \\exists q'\\in Q\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathbb F\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{calc}(j,P,Q_1,q')\\land Q_1(a_c,b_c)\\ne0\\land vQ_1(a_c,b_c)=P(a_c,b_c)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}\\land((j=0\\land c'=(q',h,\\tau[h\\mapsto v],r))\\lor(j=1\\land c'=(q',h,\\tau,v))))\\\\\n\\lor&\\exists j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\ \\exists q_1,q_0'\\in Q\\ (\\delta(q)=\\mathsf{eq}(j,a,q_1,q_0')\\land((v_j(c)=a\\land c'=(q_1,h,\\tau,r))\\lor(v_j(c)\\ne a\\land c'=(q_0',h,\\tau,r))))\\big].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr C_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,h,\\tau,r):q\\in Q,\\ h\\in\\mathbb Z,\\ r\\in\\mathbb F,\\ \\tau:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb F\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ |\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:\\tau(j)\\ne\\bot\\}|<\\aleph_0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_M\\coloneqq\\{(c,c')\\in\\mathscr C_M^2:c\\Rightarrow_M c'\\lor(c'=c\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathscr C_M\\ c\\Rightarrow_M d)\\},\\qquad F_M:\\mathscr C_M\\to\\mathscr C_M.","display":true},{"tex":"c^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq F_M(c^t_{M,x})\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\coloneqq(c^t_{M,x})_{t\\in\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\min(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:(c^t_{M,x}).q\\in\\{q_A,q_R\\}\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}),\\qquad\\operatorname{out}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&\\operatorname{time}_M(x)<\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_A,\\\\0&\\operatorname{time}_M(x)<\\infty,\\ (c^{\\operatorname{time}_M(x)}_{M,x}).q=q_R,\\\\\\uparrow&\\operatorname{time}_M(x)=\\infty.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":5232,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cbb4dd8eee9e878","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb C^{<\\omega}_{+}=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathbb C^n$；$\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C},\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{out}_M$ 使用 [[28-df-bss-machine]] 的等值分支复数域模型，所有输入要求正常停机。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}